{"seq":1,"slug":"creative-ai","title":"创意 AI","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/generative-ai/aigc-applications/creative-ai","wordCount":1392,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"创意-ai\">创意 AI</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>创意 AI（Creative AI）探索生成式技术在设计、艺术和内容创作中的应用。与传统工具不同，AI 不仅执行既定的操作指令，还能参与创意过程本身——生成设计方案、提供灵感参考、探索风格变体。创意 AI 的价值不在于替代人类创作者，而在于大幅降低创意探索的成本和时间，将设计师从重复性劳动中解放出来，聚焦于高层次的审美判断和创意决策。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[创意 AI 应用] --&gt; B[视觉设计]&#10;    A --&gt; C[品牌与营销]&#10;    A --&gt; D[游戏与娱乐]&#10;    A --&gt; E[时尚与产品]&#10;    B --&gt; F[UI/UX 设计]&#10;    B --&gt; G[平面设计]&#10;    C --&gt; H[广告素材]&#10;    C --&gt; I[社交媒体内容]&#10;    D --&gt; J[角色设计]&#10;    D --&gt; K[场景生成]&#10;    E --&gt; L[服装设计]&#10;    E --&gt; M[产品渲染]\">graph TD\n    A[创意 AI 应用] --&gt; B[视觉设计]\n    A --&gt; C[品牌与营销]\n    A --&gt; D[游戏与娱乐]\n    A --&gt; E[时尚与产品]\n    B --&gt; F[UI/UX 设计]\n    B --&gt; G[平面设计]\n    C --&gt; H[广告素材]\n    C --&gt; I[社交媒体内容]\n    D --&gt; J[角色设计]\n    D --&gt; K[场景生成]\n    E --&gt; L[服装设计]\n    E --&gt; M[产品渲染]</pre><p>创意 AI 的工作模式主要分为三种：从文本生成（Text-to-Design），以参考图像为基础的变体生成（Image-to-Image），以及基于草图或布局的精确控制生成（Sketch-to-Design）。每种模式适用于创意工作流的不同阶段。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>应用场景</th>\n<th>AI 角色</th>\n<th>输入</th>\n<th>输出</th>\n<th>人类角色</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>概念探索</td>\n<td>灵感生成器</td>\n<td>文本描述</td>\n<td>多个概念方案</td>\n<td>选择与方向指导</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>风格迭代</td>\n<td>变体工具</td>\n<td>参考图+指令</td>\n<td>风格变体</td>\n<td>审美判断</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>素材生产</td>\n<td>批量生成器</td>\n<td>模板+参数</td>\n<td>大量素材</td>\n<td>质量审核</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>精细调整</td>\n<td>编辑助手</td>\n<td>图像+编辑指令</td>\n<td>修改后图像</td>\n<td>细节把控</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"设计工作流中的-ai-集成\">设计工作流中的 AI 集成</h2><p>将 AI 有效集成到设计工作流中需要理解设计师的实际需求和工作模式。设计过程通常分为：调研与灵感收集、概念生成、方案评审、细节精修和最终输出。AI 在不同阶段的角色和价值不同。</p>\n<p>在概念生成阶段，AI 的最大价值是快速产出大量视觉方案。设计师通常需要在短时间内生成数十个方向的概念图，然后从中筛选最有潜力的方向进行深化。使用 Stable Diffusion 或 Midjourney，这个过程可以从数小时缩短到数分钟。关键不是每张生成图的完美度，而是覆盖足够广的创意空间。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from diffusers import StableDiffusionXLPipeline, DPMSolverMultistepScheduler&#10;import torch&#10;from itertools import product&#10;&#10;class ConceptExplorer:&#10;    def __init__(self, model_id=&quot;stabilityai/stable-diffusion-xl-base-1.0&quot;):&#10;        self.pipe = StableDiffusionXLPipeline.from_pretrained(&#10;            model_id, torch_dtype=torch.float16&#10;        ).to(&quot;cuda&quot;)&#10;        self.pipe.scheduler = DPMSolverMultistepScheduler.from_config(&#10;            self.pipe.scheduler.config&#10;        )&#10;&#10;    def explore_concepts(self, base_prompt, styles, moods, n_per_combo=2):&#10;        results = []&#10;        for style, mood in product(styles, moods):&#10;            prompt = f&quot;{base_prompt}, {style} style, {mood} mood, professional design&quot;&#10;            for seed in range(n_per_combo):&#10;                image = self.pipe(&#10;                    prompt=prompt,&#10;                    negative_prompt=&quot;low quality, amateur, cluttered&quot;,&#10;                    num_inference_steps=25,&#10;                    guidance_scale=7.0,&#10;                    generator=torch.Generator(&quot;cuda&quot;).manual_seed(seed * 42),&#10;                ).images[0]&#10;                results.append({&quot;image&quot;: image, &quot;style&quot;: style, &quot;mood&quot;: mood, &quot;seed&quot;: seed})&#10;        return results&#10;&#10;explorer = ConceptExplorer()&#10;concepts = explorer.explore_concepts(&#10;    base_prompt=&quot;modern coffee shop interior&quot;,&#10;    styles=[&quot;minimalist&quot;, &quot;industrial&quot;, &quot;scandinavian&quot;, &quot;japanese&quot;],&#10;    moods=[&quot;warm and cozy&quot;, &quot;bright and airy&quot;, &quot;moody and dramatic&quot;],&#10;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> diffusers </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> StableDiffusionXLPipeline, DPMSolverMultistepScheduler</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> itertools </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> product</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ConceptExplorer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, model_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"stabilityai/stable-diffusion-xl-base-1.0\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.pipe </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> StableDiffusionXLPipeline.from_pretrained(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            model_id, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">torch_dtype</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">torch.float16</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        ).to(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"cuda\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.pipe.scheduler </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> DPMSolverMultistepScheduler.from_config(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.pipe.scheduler.config</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> explore_concepts</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, base_prompt, styles, moods, n_per_combo</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        results </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> style, mood </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> product(styles, moods):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            prompt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">base_prompt</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">style</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> style, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">mood</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> mood, professional design\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> seed </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(n_per_combo):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                image </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.pipe(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">                    prompt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">prompt,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">                    negative_prompt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"low quality, amateur, cluttered\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">                    num_inference_steps</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">25</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">                    guidance_scale</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">7.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">                    generator</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">torch.Generator(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"cuda\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).manual_seed(seed </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 42</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                ).images[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                results.append({</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"image\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: image, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"style\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: style, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"mood\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: mood, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"seed\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: seed})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> results</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">explorer </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ConceptExplorer()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">concepts </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> explorer.explore_concepts(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    base_prompt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"modern coffee shop interior\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    styles</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"minimalist\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"industrial\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"scandinavian\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"japanese\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    moods</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"warm and cozy\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"bright and airy\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"moody and dramatic\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph 设计工作流&#10;        A[需求分析] --&gt; B[AI 概念探索]&#10;        B --&gt; C[人工筛选方向]&#10;        C --&gt; D[AI 变体生成]&#10;        D --&gt; E[人工精修]&#10;        E --&gt; F[最终输出]&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph 设计工作流\n        A[需求分析] --&gt; B[AI 概念探索]\n        B --&gt; C[人工筛选方向]\n        C --&gt; D[AI 变体生成]\n        D --&gt; E[人工精修]\n        E --&gt; F[最终输出]\n    end</pre><p>在精修阶段，AI 工具的角色转变为精确的编辑助手。通过 Inpainting 替换局部元素，通过 ControlNet 保持布局一致性，通过 IP-Adapter 统一风格。设计师此时需要的是精确控制而非创意发散，这要求工具能够理解和执行具体的修改指令。</p>\n<h2 id=\"风格迁移与品牌一致性\">风格迁移与品牌一致性</h2><p>品牌设计中的一个核心挑战是在不同场景和媒介中保持视觉一致性。AI 可以通过风格迁移、LoRA 微调和 IP-Adapter 等技术学习品牌的视觉语言，然后在各种场景中自动应用。</p>\n<p>LoRA 微调是实现品牌风格一致性的最常用方法。通过在 20-50 张品牌设计素材上微调 Stable Diffusion 的 LoRA 权重，模型可以学习品牌的配色方案、排版风格、插图风格等视觉特征。微调后的模型在新场景中生成的内容自然继承了品牌的视觉基因。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import torch&#10;from diffusers import StableDiffusionPipeline&#10;&#10;class BrandConsistentGenerator:&#10;    def __init__(self, base_model, brand_lora_path):&#10;        self.pipe = StableDiffusionPipeline.from_pretrained(&#10;            base_model, torch_dtype=torch.float16&#10;        ).to(&quot;cuda&quot;)&#10;        self.pipe.load_lora_weights(brand_lora_path)&#10;&#10;    def generate_brand_asset(self, content_description, asset_type=&quot;social_media&quot;):&#10;        templates = {&#10;            &quot;social_media&quot;: &quot;social media post design, clean layout, brand style&quot;,&#10;            &quot;banner&quot;: &quot;web banner design, wide format, brand style&quot;,&#10;            &quot;icon&quot;: &quot;app icon design, minimal, brand style&quot;,&#10;        }&#10;        prompt = f&quot;{content_description}, {templates[asset_type]}&quot;&#10;        return self.pipe(&#10;            prompt=prompt,&#10;            negative_prompt=&quot;off-brand, inconsistent style, low quality&quot;,&#10;            num_inference_steps=25,&#10;            guidance_scale=7.0,&#10;        ).images[0]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> diffusers </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> StableDiffusionPipeline</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> BrandConsistentGenerator</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, base_model, brand_lora_path):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.pipe </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> StableDiffusionPipeline.from_pretrained(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            base_model, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">torch_dtype</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">torch.float16</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        ).to(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"cuda\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.pipe.load_lora_weights(brand_lora_path)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> generate_brand_asset</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, content_description, asset_type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"social_media\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        templates </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            \"social_media\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"social media post design, clean layout, brand style\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            \"banner\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"web banner design, wide format, brand style\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            \"icon\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"app icon design, minimal, brand style\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        prompt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">content_description</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">templates[asset_type]</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.pipe(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">            prompt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">prompt,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">            negative_prompt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"off-brand, inconsistent style, low quality\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">            num_inference_steps</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">25</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">            guidance_scale</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">7.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        ).images[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>风格控制方法</th>\n<th>学习对象</th>\n<th>训练数据量</th>\n<th>一致性</th>\n<th>灵活性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>LoRA 微调</td>\n<td>全局风格</td>\n<td>20-50 张</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Textual Inversion</td>\n<td>概念嵌入</td>\n<td>5-10 张</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>IP-Adapter</td>\n<td>参考风格</td>\n<td>无需训练</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DreamBooth</td>\n<td>特定对象</td>\n<td>10-30 张</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"个性化内容与大规模定制\">个性化内容与大规模定制</h2><p>个性化内容生成是 AI 在营销和电商领域的杀手级应用。传统上，为不同用户群体定制视觉内容需要大量的设计资源；AI 可以基于用户画像、场景参数和品牌模板实现近实时的个性化内容生成。</p>\n<p>在电商场景中，产品图的个性化包括：为不同区域市场替换背景场景，为不同受众调整模特形象，为不同营销活动替换文案和配色。通过参数化的生成管线，单个产品可以自动产出数十个变体，用于 A/B 测试和程序化广告投放。</p>\n<p>游戏行业是创意 AI 的另一个重要应用领域。AI 辅助角色设计、场景概念图、纹理贴图和 UI 元素生成已经进入实际生产管线。Scenario.gg 和 Leonardo.ai 等专业平台提供了针对游戏行业的微调模型和控制工具。关键区别在于：游戏资产有严格的技术规格要求（分辨率、通道、tileable 等），生成的内容需要进一步加工才能用于实际游戏引擎。</p>\n<p>创意 AI 的成熟度因应用场景而异。概念探索和灵感生成已经高度可用，素材量产在标准化程度高的场景中（如电商产品图、社交媒体模板）已经可以实现半自动化，而高度创意性的工作（如品牌标识设计、艺术创作）中 AI 更多作为辅助工具存在。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((创意 AI))&#10;    工作流集成&#10;      概念探索&#10;      变体迭代&#10;      精细编辑&#10;    风格控制&#10;      LoRA 微调&#10;      IP-Adapter&#10;      品牌一致性&#10;    应用场景&#10;      视觉设计&#10;      品牌营销&#10;      游戏娱乐&#10;    人机协作&#10;      AI 生成 + 人工筛选&#10;      AI 辅助 + 人工主导&#10;      批量生产 + 质量审核\">mindmap\n  root((创意 AI))\n    工作流集成\n      概念探索\n      变体迭代\n      精细编辑\n    风格控制\n      LoRA 微调\n      IP-Adapter\n      品牌一致性\n    应用场景\n      视觉设计\n      品牌营销\n      游戏娱乐\n    人机协作\n      AI 生成 + 人工筛选\n      AI 辅助 + 人工主导\n      批量生产 + 质量审核</pre><ul>\n<li>创意 AI 的核心价值是降低创意探索成本，而非替代人类创作者的审美判断</li>\n<li>AI 在设计工作流的不同阶段扮演不同角色：概念阶段是灵感生成器，精修阶段是编辑助手</li>\n<li>LoRA 微调是实现品牌风格一致性的最实用方法，20-50 张样本即可训练</li>\n<li>个性化内容生成在电商和营销领域具有巨大商业价值</li>\n<li>创意 AI 工具的成熟度因场景而异，标准化程度越高的场景自动化程度越高</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"创意 AI","id":"创意-ai"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"设计工作流中的 AI 集成","id":"设计工作流中的-ai-集成"},{"level":2,"text":"风格迁移与品牌一致性","id":"风格迁移与品牌一致性"},{"level":2,"text":"个性化内容与大规模定制","id":"个性化内容与大规模定制"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"跨模态统一生成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/generative-ai/multimodal-generation/cross-modal-generation"},"next":{"title":"代码生成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/generative-ai/aigc-applications/code-generation"}}